    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61780" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰλ-ιά</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰλ-ιή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>talk, chat</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαλιὰν
				ἀσκῆσαι, ἐπιτηδεῦσαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				931
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1069
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέρας ποιεῖ λαλιᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					66.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermesian.
				7.78
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.440
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>); <i>common talk, report</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.20.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς εὐανδρίας τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ma.</u>
					8.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.134
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαλιάν τινα ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					42.11
				</span></i>
			; in good sense, <i>discussion</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περὶ βυβλίων λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					31.23.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				36.12.3
			</span></i>; <i>speech, conversation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Jo.
				8.43
			</span></i>; <i>matter, subject</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ec.</u>
				3.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
